    "original_requirement": "实现一个冷库多级告警与保护系统，使用两个 LM35，环境温度 A0、蒸发器温度 A1，门磁 D2、风扇 D5、除霜继电器 D10、蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D5）和串口。系统需要根据环境温度控制风扇，根据蒸发器温度判断是否进入除霜流程；门打开时暂停部分控制并计时。若环境温度超上限、蒸发器结霜严重或门长时间未关，则进入不同级别告警并输出详细状态。",
    "effective_requirement": "实现一个冷库多级告警与保护系统，使用两个 LM35，环境温度 A0、蒸发器温度 A1，门磁 D2、风扇 D5、除霜继电器 D10、蜂鸣器 D6、TM1637（CLK=D4，DIO=D3）和串口。系统需要根据环境温度控制风扇，根据蒸发器温度判断是否进入除霜流程；门打开时暂停部分控制并计时。若环境温度超上限、蒸发器结霜严重或门长时间未关，则进入不同级别告警并输出详细状态。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A0\"}, {\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A1\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D10\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D5\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tm1637_number\", \"clk_pin\": \"D4\", \"dio_pin\": \"D3\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
